: "game", "period": "month", "rank": 70, "date": "2023-07-31"}], "images": {"main": "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_main.jpg", "thumb": "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp6.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp7.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp8.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp9.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp6_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp7_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp8_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01063000/RJ01062115_img_smp9_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "エルフ村の成人式 [Hoi Hoi Hoi]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "", "body": [{"intro": "回想部屋あり<br />\r\n基本CG 30枚<br />\r\nイベント回収型RPG<br />\r\n<br />\r\n攻略/Guide:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://waterbears423.com/~hoi/#/guide/vx02\" target=\"_blank\">https://waterbears423.com/~hoi/#/guide/vx02</a><br />\r\n<br />\r\nTWITTER<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/hoi0609\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/hoi0609</a>"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "エルフ村の成人式", "body": [{"intro": "エルフは、長い寿命を持つが子供の少ない種族。<br />\r\n加えて先の魔族との戦いで、たくさんのエルフの若者が命を落としてしまった故……<br />\r\n今のエルフ族は絶滅の危機に瀕している。<br />\r\nエルフ村の3人は成人の年齢に達した。<br />\r\nつまり、彼らが村に貢献する時がついに来たのだ。<br />\r\n恋人同士のアルとエヴァは、エルフの子を産むように告げられる。<br />\r\nしかし、エルフ族は性欲が非常に弱く、子供を作ることが難しい。<br />\r\nそのため行うのが——エルフ村の成人式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "精靈村的成人儀式", "body": [{"intro": "精靈族,是雖然壽命長但生育卻不多的族群。<br />\r\n再加上在先前與魔族的大戰中,許多年輕的精靈族都殞命了的緣故……<br />\r\n現在的精靈族正面臨著瀕臨絕種的危機。<br />\r\n精靈村的3人已經迎來成人的年紀。<br />\r\n也就是說,他們為村子作出貢獻的時候到了。<br />\r\n戀人關係的阿爾跟伊娃被告知他們需要生下精靈族的後代。<br />\r\n然而,精靈族的性欲本來就非常低落,難以生育。<br />\r\n而為此進行的就是——精靈村的成人儀式。"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "Seijin Shiki of Elves", "body": [{"intro": "Elves are a race with long lifespans but few children.<br />\r\nIn addition, many young elves lost their lives in the battle with the demons earlier...<br />\r\nElves are now in danger of extinction.<br />\r\nThe three elven villagers have reached adulthood.<br />\r\nSo it's finally time for them to contribute to the village.<br />\r\nAru and Eva, lovers, are told to have an elf child.<br />\r\nHowever, elves have a very weak libido and find it difficult to have children.<br />\r\nThat's why it's held - the Seijin Shiki of Elves."}]}], "description": "エルフとして試練を通過し、村の成人式を迎えるRPG", "short_introduction": "エルフとして試練を通過し、村の成人式を迎えるRPG", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01062115.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794952903}